<section class="section--surface" id="faq">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="label">FAQ</span>
    <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>How do I get to my plans in TrainingPeaks?</h3>
      <p>All-Access is delivered through your TrainingPeaks account, not through this site. Log in there (web or app) with the email you subscribed with and go to <strong>Plans &rarr; Explore</strong> to see the full catalogue. Assign whichever one you want to your calendar — with All-Access you can switch plans as often as you like. TrainingPeaks Premium is already included on the same account.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>Where are the downloadable guides?</h3>
      <p>The downloadable guides are at <a href="/members/en/downloads/">triaperformance.com/members/en/downloads</a> — no second login needed.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>I forgot my password. How do I get back in?</h3>
      <p>Use the <a href="/members/en/forgot-password/">recovery page</a> — enter the email you subscribed with and we will resend your access.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>How do I manage or cancel my subscription?</h3>
      <p>Your subscription is handled directly in TrainingPeaks Payments — billing, changes and cancellation all happen from your TrainingPeaks account, not here.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>What exactly does All-Access include?</h3>
      <p>Every training plan in the catalogue, across every sport, distance and language, unlimited plan changes, TrainingPeaks Premium, the downloadable guides, and this library of tools — all on one monthly subscription.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
